- dimension:dim_seasons.season_name [label; model dim_seasons; string] The name of the sports season.
- dimension:dim_seasons.start_date [categorical; model dim_seasons; string] The start date of the sports season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.age [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Player age at time of bio record. NULL when bio record is absent.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.ast_delta [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Season-over-season change in total assists (current season minus prior season). NULL for a player's first (rookie) season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.avg_field_goal_pct [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Average field goal percentage across games played in this season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.avg_free_throw_pct [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Average free throw percentage across games played in this season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.avg_three_point_pct [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Average three-point percentage across games played in this season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.birth_date [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Player date of birth. NULL when bio record is absent.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.career_ast [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Cumulative career assists through and including this season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.career_games_played [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Cumulative career games played through and including this season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.career_pts [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Cumulative career points through and including this season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.career_reb [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Cumulative career rebounds through and including this season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.career_season_number [key; model fct_player_journey; string] Ordinal position of this season in the player's career. 1 = rookie season; increments by 1 for each subsequent season ordered ascending.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.efficiency_delta [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Season-over-season change in efficiency rating (current season minus prior season). NULL for a player's first (rookie) season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.efficiency_rating [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Player efficiency rating (EFF) for the season. Formula: (PTS + REB + AST + STL + BLK - missed FG - missed FT - TOV) / games_played. NULL when games_played = 0.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.games_played [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Number of distinct games played by the player in this season.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.player_id [key; model fct_player_journey; string] Surrogate identifier for the player, sourced from src_players.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.player_name [label; model fct_player_journey; string] Full name of the player.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.player_position [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] Player's listed position (e.g. G, F, C). NULL when bio record is absent.
- dimension:fct_player_journey.season [categorical; model fct_player_journey; string] NBA season year (integer).
