BUSINESS CONCEPTS (one thing known under several keys; a concept ref is a question to the reader, never a grouping — name the binding you mean)
- concept:nba.player [concept; reviewed; nba] An NBA player, identified by player_id in every table. The project has no one-row-per-player table: list players from player_season (local_player_season_facts)  bound to: relation:TRANSFORMED.local_player_season_facts (nba, canonical) one row per player_id, season; relation:TRANSFORMED.local_player_game_facts (nba, conformed) one row per game_id, team_id, player_id aka athlete

