- model:local_team_season_facts [model TRANSFORMED.local_team_season_facts] Local DuckDB team-season aggregate derived only from local_team_game_facts. Grain is one row per team per source season.
- model:src_games [model TRANSFORMED.src_games] Source table containing raw games data.

