- relation:TRANSFORMED.fct_player_journey [] Season-by-season journey for every NBA player. One row represents one player's performance in one NBA season. Grain: (player_id, season) — periodic snapshot fact.  is: Not for analysis: built on int_season_stats, so it covers 2009-2019 only and counts DNP games as played; career totals and career_season_number start in 2009. U one row per one row per player per season (player_id, season), 2009-2019 only aka TRANSFORMED.fct_player_journey, Legacy player journey (do not use) columns: avg_field_goal_pct, avg_free_throw_pct, avg_three_point_pct, games_played, efficiency_rating, career_games_played, player_id, player_name, season, career_season_number, total_points, total_assists, total_rebounds, total_steals, total_blocks, total_turnovers, total_personal_fouls, total_field_goals_made, total_field_goals_attempted, total_three_points_made, total_three_points_attempted, total_free_throws_made, total_free_throws_attempted, pts_delta, ast_delta, reb_delta, efficiency_delta, career_pts, career_ast, career_reb, team_id, player_position, height_cm, weight, birth_date, age, school
- relation:TRANSFORMED.local_player_season_facts [] Local DuckDB full-history player-season aggregate. Grain is one row per player_id and source season. Totals and games_played use participated player-game rows only. is: A player's totals for one season: one row per player_id and season (2003-2022, all game types combined). Counts only games the player played (participated). Use one row per one row per player per season (player_id, season) aka TRANSFORMED.local_player_season_facts, Player season columns: games_played, assists_per_game, points_per_game, rebounds_per_game
